@startuml
skinparam dpi 300
' or:
scale 2
' or:
scale max 2000 width
title Transaction monitoring & statistics (Finance/Accounting) - with reconciliation against intermediary payment partner

|Accounting/Finance|
start
:Select "Monitoring / Reporting";
:Select reporting period (day/week/month);
:Select statistic type\n(Top-up / Payment / Refund / Transfer / Fees...);
:Set filters\n(time range, channel, status);

|Internal Wallet System|
:Retrieve data based on filters;
:Aggregate metrics;\nDisplay dashboard/table;

|Accounting/Finance|
if (Need reconciliation with payment partner?) then (Yes)
  :Select reconciliation type\n(top-up / payment / refund);
  :Enter reconciliation time range;

  |Intermediary Payment Partner|
  :Provide transaction data for the time range\n(list + totals + status);

  |Internal Wallet System|
  :Receive partner data;
  :Compare totals;\nIdentify discrepancies (if any);

  |Accounting/Finance|
  if (Any discrepancies?) then (Yes)
    :View discrepancy list;
    :Add initial notes / suspected causes;
  else (No)
    :Confirm figures match;
  endif
endif

|Accounting/Finance|
if (Need transaction details?) then (Yes)
  :Select a metric/time point;
  |Internal Wallet System|
  :Display detailed transaction list;
  |Accounting/Finance|
  :Review details / quick cross-check;
endif

|Accounting/Finance|
if (Need to export report?) then (Yes)
  |Internal Wallet System|
  :Generate report file (Excel/PDF/CSV);
  :Log report export history;
  |Accounting/Finance|
  :Download report;
endif

|Accounting/Finance|
if (Anomaly detected?) then (Yes)
  :Flag and add notes;
  |Internal Wallet System|
  :Save monitoring notes;
endif

|Accounting/Finance|
stop
@enduml
